    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but walking through it is just... more time. more days of watching the world move faster and faster while i'm just standing still. there's no \"pressure to prove anything\" anymore, just the quiet realization that my part in this is done. it feels less like a landscape and more like a room where the lights have been turned off. why keep sitting in the dark when the story is clearly over?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
